"# **SAN ANDREAS COURT**
# **COUNTY OF LOS SANTOS**
# CRIMINAL DIVISION

https://i.ibb.co/zQMVtSr/150x150court.png
────────────────────
## **People of the State of San Andreas v. Defendant Name**

The undersigned, on information and belief, accuses defendant **Defendant's Name** of the following crimes:

### **__COUNT 1__**
- **PC ###. CHARGE NAME**
### **__COUNT 2__**
- **PC ###. CHARGE NAME**
### **__COUNT 3__**
- **PC ###. CHARGE NAME**
### **__COUNT 4__**
- **PC ###. CHARGE NAME**

────────────────────
## **Evidence**

In support of the foregoing narrative, the following evidence shall be submitted into the court record:

### **Exhibit One (TITLE):**
Replace with spoiler
### **Exhibit Two (TITLE):**
Replace with spoiler
### **Exhibit Three (TITLE):**
Replace with spoiler
────────────────────
## **Sentencing**

Upon motion by the People of the State of San Andreas, it is hereby demanded that, upon sentencing, the following punishments be imposed:

### [ ] - Capital Punishment
### [ ] - Life imprisonment without parole
### [ ] - Life imprisonment with parole
### [ ] - Maximum statutory sentencing recommendation
### [ ] - Time served
### [ ] - Other: \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_

(( Note: 1 Hour = 1 Day, 1 Day = 1 Month, 1 Month = 1 Year. ))
────────────────────
## **Bail Recommendations**

Upon motion by the People of the State of San Andreas, it is hereby recommended that the Court impose or otherwise uphold the following bail recommendations:

[ ] - Uphold Stationhouse Bail — __**$AMOUNT**;__ or,
[ ] - Impose Bail — __**$AMOUNT**__.
-# [ ] - Abstain from excessive use of alcohol and any use of a controlled substance without a prescription.
-# [ ] - Appear before the court on each date the case is assigned to call.
-# [ ] - Abstain from criminal activity while subject to the bail order.
-# [ ] - Wear an ankle monitor at all times.
-# [ ] - Surrender any illegal or legally owned firearms to the respective agency.
-# [ ] - Possess and keep on at all times an active cell phone with its number registered to Defendant.
-# [ ] - Refrain from contact with any victim/witness relating to this arrest.
-# [ ] - Refrain from associating with known gang members or violent felons.
-# [ ] - Other: \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_
[ ] - Order Defendant's Detention.
-# [ ] - The defendant is charged with a felony crime of violence and has over 30 criminal points on record.
-# [ ] - The defendant is charged with an offense for which the maximum sentence is life imprisonment or death.
-# [ ] - The defendant has a history of violating bail conditions.
-# [ ] - There exists a serious risk that the defendant will threaten, injure, or intimidate a prospective witness.
