exports[`toDiscord on every form > criminal-pending-judicial-assignment > empty, code tables 1`] = `
"────────────────────
## **NOTICE OF PENDING JUDICIAL ASSIGNMENT**

PLEASE TAKE NOTICE that this matter has been successfully filed and docketed with the Court. As of the date of this filing, a presiding judge has not yet been assigned to this matter. This case is currently awaiting the availability of a judicial officer. Parties will be notified immediately once a judge has been assigned.

The defendant is ordered to enter a formal appearance at the courthouse within 48 hours. Failure to appear within this timeframe will result in summary judgment. Pending the assignment of a judge, the defendant must initiate the process of securing legal representation.

- If the defendant possesses the financial means, they must retain private counsel immediately (( [#law-firm-ads, #attorney request](https://discord.com/invite/tBZuDR8agK) )).
- If the defendant does not have the means to hire an attorney, and requires court-appointed counsel, they must fill out a pro bono attorney request.

Dated:
Los Santos County Superior Court

-# (( OOC note: if not done already, the defendant must roleplay appearing as a response to this thread. ))
────────────────────"
`;

