Failure to appear without lawful excuse may constitute contempt of court and may subject you to sanctions or the issuance of a bench warrant, as permitted by law.

**ISSUED BY ORDER OF THE COURT**

__FIRSTNAME LASTNAME__
(COURT COMISSIONER OR JUDGE OF THE SUPERIOR COURT)

__SIGNATURE__
(SIGNATURE)"
`;

