exports[`toDiscord on every form > extra-retainer-agreement > empty, code tables 1`] = `
"## **RETAINER AGREEMENT**
This Retainer Agreement is made on \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_ between FIRM NAME (the "Firm") and CLIENT NAME of CLIENT ADDRESS (the "Client") for representation in THE MATTER (Case No. to be assigned).
**1. Fees.** The Client will pay the Firm $\\_\\_\\_\\_ per hour for time spent on the matter, billed in increments of 6 minutes.
**2. Retainer.** The Client will pay a retainer of $\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_ before work begins. It is held in the Firm's client trust account and applied to invoices as they fall due. When it falls below $\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_, the Client will bring it back up to the full amount.
**3. Payment terms.** Invoices are due within 14 days of receipt.
**4. Costs.** Court fees and other costs paid on the Client's behalf are charged at cost, in addition to the Firm's fees.
**5. Ending the agreement.** Either party may end this agreement by written notice. Fees earned and costs incurred up to that date remain payable; any unused retainer is returned to the Client.
**6. No guarantee.** The Firm cannot promise any outcome. Any view it gives on the likely result is an opinion, not a guarantee.
**7. Governing law.** This agreement is governed by the laws of the State of San Andreas.
────────────────────
\`\`\`
FOR THE FIRM          CLIENT
SIGNATURE             ____________________

____________________  CLIENT NAME
Attorney at Law       Date: __________
Bar No. __________
\`\`\`"
`;

