exports[`toDiscord on every form > misc-decree-of-adoption > empty, code tables 1`] = `
"# **SAN ANDREAS COURT**
# __COUNTY OF LOS SANTOS__
# CIVIL DIVISION

────────────────────
\`\`\`
┌───────────────┐  )  Court File: YYSCCCNNNN
│ NAME SURNAME  │  )
│ (Petitioners) │  )  ┌────────────────────┐
│               │  )  │ DECREE OF ADOPTION │
│ - and -       │  )  └────────────────────┘
│               │  )
│ NAME SURNAME  │  )  Action Filed: Month DD, YYYY
│ (Minor)       │  )
└───────────────┘
\`\`\`
────────────────────
**DECREE OF ADOPTION**

This Court, having reviewed the Petition for Adoption filed by the Petitioners, NAME SURNAME and NAME SURNAME, and the matter coming on regularly to be heard before this Court on the date and time above, and the Petitioners appearing personally, and it appearing to the satisfaction of the Court that all required consents to adoption have been filed with this Court and the Court having considered said documents, and the Court having further examined all documents executed and filed herein, and finding them in all respects proper, and the Court having reviewed the child welfare services investigation; and having examined the Petitioners under oath, from which examination the Court finds that all of the allegations of said Petition are true; if there are two Petitioners, they are married; the Petitioners have been residents of Los Santos County for at least six months; the Petitioners are more than ten years older than the minor child(ren); the Petitioners are financially able to provide for the support and maintenance of the minor child(ren); and it further appearing to the satisfaction of the Court that the best interests of the child(ren) will be promoted by this adoption; and it further appearing to the Court that there has been a full compliance with the laws of the State of San Andreas.

IT IS THEREFORE ORDERED that the Petitioner are declared the legal and adoptive parents of the following child(ren):

NAME SURNAME, XX years of age.

IT IS FURTHER ORDERED that if a Petitioner has existing parental rights to the child(ren), those rights shall remain unaffected.

IT IS FURTHER ORDERED that the minor child(ren)'s names shall be changed from NAME SURNAME to NAME SURNAME.

IT IS FURTHER ORDERED that any other parent named on the child(ren)'s birth certificates shall be removed, and Petitioners' names shall appear on the birth certificate as the only parents to the child(ren).

IT IS FURTHER ORDERED that the minor child(ren) shall henceforth be regarded and treated as Petitioner's natural child and have all the lawful rights as their own child, including the rights of support, protection and inheritance.

It is henceforth ordered by judge NAME SURNAME, and shall be carried out without delay.

────────────────────

**REGISTRY**

This document is accepted for registration on MONTH DAY, YEAR, offered a copy to the parties and the original stored in the Superior Court archive, by the local registrar, authorized by the Court Administrator.

────────────────────

**(( NAMECHANGE ))**

If during this case the kid took upon the last name of the new parents, it is recommended namechanging by marking the Marriage/Adoption checkbox in the UCP, proceeding to change the last name of the character to the one present in this document, given the legal name of the character is changing from the moment this document is published.

This is **NOT MANDATORY** as it requires to have an available namechange, which some people may not have, but it is heavily recommended. Namechanges can be acquired through Panda Points (free) through the Activity Rewards area in the I menu, in game.

**[>>>GUIDE TO PERFORM THE NAMECHANGE\\<\\<\\<](https://i.imgur.com/76ngTQX.png)**"
`;

