exports[`toDiscord on every form > misc-marriage-license-certificate > empty, code tables 1`] = `
"# **SAN ANDREAS COURT**
# __COUNTY OF LOS SANTOS__
# CIVIL DIVISION

────────────────────
\`\`\`
┌──────────┐  )  Court File: --SCCC-----
│ John Doe │  )
│ (Spouse) │  )  ┌─────────────────────┐
│          │  )  │ LICENSE OF MARRIAGE │
│ - and -  │  )  └─────────────────────┘
│          │  )
│ Jane Doe │  )  Action Filed: Month Day, Year
│ (Spouse) │  )
└──────────┘
\`\`\`
────────────────────
**I. PERSONAL DATA OF SPOUSES**

**[1]** The full name of the first spouse is John Doe.
**[2]** JOHN DOE was born on DAY MONTH YEAR in CITY, STATE, COUNTRY.
**[3]** JOHN DOE affirms that HE/SHE has not previously entered into any marriage, neither documented in official records nor to the best of HIS/HER knowledge.
**[4]** HIS/HER current residential address is: ADDRESS HERE.
**[5]** The names of HIS/HER parents are NAME SURNAME and NAME SURNAME.

**[6]** The full name of the first spouse is Jane Doe.
**[7]** JANE DOE was born on DAY MONTH YEAR in CITY, STATE, COUNTRY.
**[8]** JANE DOE affirms that HE/SHE has not previously entered into any marriage, neither documented in official records nor to the best of HIS/HER knowledge.
**[9]** HIS/HER current residential address is: ADDRESS HERE.
**[10]** The names of HIS/HER parents are NAME SURNAME and NAME SURNAME.

────────────────────
**II. AFFIDAVIT**

WE, THE UNDERSIGNED, DECLARE UNDER PENALTY OF PERJURY UNDER THE LAWS OF THE STATE OF SAN ANDREAS THAT WE ARE UNMARRIED AND THAT THE FOREGOING INFORMATION IS TRUE AND CORRECT TO THE BEST OF OUR KNOWLEDGE AND BELIEF. WE FURTHER DECLARE THAT NO LEGAL OBJECTION TO THE MARRIAGE NOR TO THE ISSUANCE OF A LICENSE IS KNOWN TO US. WE ACKNOWLEDGE RECEIPT OF THE INFORMATION REQUIRED BY THE MARRIAGE ACT OF 2021 AND HEREBY APPLY FOR A LICENSE AND CERTIFICATE OF MARRIAGE.

**\\*\\* The signatures of JOHN DOE and JANE DOE would be seen here \\*\\***

────────────────────

**III. LICENSE TO MARRY**

I, THE UNDERSIGNED, DO HEREBY CERTIFY THAT THE ABOVE-NAMED PARTIES TO BE MARRIED HAVE PERSONALLY APPEARED BEFORE ME. THE PARTIES PROVED TO ME ON THE BASIS OF SATISFACTORY EVIDENCE TO BE THE PERSONS CLAIMED, HAVE DECLARED THAT THEY MEET ALL OF THE REQUIREMENTS OF THE LAW, AND HAVE PAID THE FEES PRESCRIBED BY LAW. AUTHORIZATION AND LICENSE IS HEREBY GIVEN TO ANY PERSON DULY AUTHORIZED TO PERFORM A MARRIAGE CEREMONY WITHIN THE STATE OF SAN ANDREAS TO SOLEMNIZE THE MARRIAGE OF THE ABOVE-NAMED PERSONS. REQUIRED CONSENTS AND AFFIDAVITS FOR THE ISSUANCE OF THIS LICENSE ARE ON FILE.

**\\*\\* A digital signature would be present here, showing the following details: *ELECTRONICALLY SIGNED BY JUDGE NAME SURNAME OF THE SUPERIOR COURT ON MONTH, DAY, YEAR, HOUR, USING A SECURE, TIME-STAMPED, ELECTRONIC SIGNATURE IN COMPLIANCE WITH APPLICABLE STATUTORY REGULATIONS*. \\*\\***

**[11]** The issuance date is DAY MONTH YEAR, expiring after DAY MONTH YEAR, under marriage license number DOCKET NUMBER, issued in the United States of America, in the County of Los Santos, State of San Andreas.

────────────────────
**IV. WITNESSES**
**[12]** The full name of the witness is NAME SURNAME, who signs henceforth, having witnessed the ceremony:

**\\*\\* The signature of NAME SURNAME would be seen here \\*\\***

────────────────────
**V. CERTIFICATION OF PERSON SOLEMNIZING MARRIAGE**

I, THE UNDERSIGNED, DECLARE UNDER PENALTY OF PERJURY UNDER THE LAWS OF THE STATE OF SAN ANDREAS THAT THE ABOVE-NAMED PARTIES WERE JOINED BY ME IN MARRIAGE IN ACCORDANCE WITH THE LAWS OF THE STATE OF SAN ANDREAS, WITH THE MARRIAGE CEREMONY TAKING PLACE IN THE STATE OF SAN ANDREAS.

**\\*\\* The signature of NAME SURNAME (JUDGE) would be seen here \\*\\***

**[15]** The marriage has taken place on DAY, MONTH, YEAR, in the city and county of Los Santos.

**[16]** The full name of the person solemnizing marriage is NAME SURNAME (JUDGE), under the official title of Judge of the SAN ANDREAS COURT.

────────────────────
**VI. NEW NAMES**

**[17]** The first spouse under field [1] will CHANGE/MAINTAIN their full name TO/AS NAME SURNAME.

**[18]** The second spouse under field [6] will CHANGE/MAINTAIN their full name TO/AS NAME SURNAME.

────────────────────
**VII. REGISTRY**

**[19]** This document is accepted for registration on DAY MONTH YEAR, offered a copy to the parties and the original stored in the Superior Court archive, by the local registrar, authorized by the Court Clerk, Mary Anne Hopkins."
`;

