exports[`toDiscord on every form > small-claims-defendants-response > empty, code tables 1`] = `
"────────────────────
### **Defendant's Response**
BRANCH NAME: __LOS SANTOS__
COURTHOUSE NAME: __SUPERIOR COURT__
CASE NUMBER: __YYSCSM#####__
FILING DATE: __DD/MMM/YYYY__
PLAINTIFF: __INSERT NAME__
DEFENDANT: __INSERT NAME__
────────────────────
**1. Do you agree with the complaint filed against you and waive your right to trial? If you answer "yes", the claim will not go to trial and you will be ordered to pay the amount of money the plaintiff requested. Do not fill out sections 2a, 2b, 2c if you agree with the complaint. If you answer "no", this case will go to trial.**
*Yes / No*

────────────────────

**2a. Submit any evidence you may have below. Each piece of evidence should have its own letter assigned in alphabetical order. More entries should be added if necessary.**

**Exhibit A:**

**Exhibit B:**

**2b. If evidence exists that you have no access to, please explain below what the evidence is. You must also provide the name of the person, corporation, or public entity that holds the evidence.**
*Answer here.*

**2c. You may call up to one witness if they are crucial to your case. If you have a crucial witness, provide their name below, along with an explanation as to why they are crucial to argue your claim.**
*Answer here.*

────────────────────

I, *Insert Name*, affirm that the above-stated facts are true and accurate to the best of my knowledge and belief. This document serves as my official response to the complaint filed against me.
────────────────────"
`;

