### **Judgment was entered as checked below:**
[X] Defendant *X\\<&>"1 X2* shall pay plaintiff *X\\<&>"1 X2* $__X\\<&>"1 X2__.
[X] Defendant does not owe plaintiff any money on plaintiff's claim.

**Transcript:**
||X\\<&>"1||

||X2||

It is henceforth ordered by Judge X\\<&>"1 X2, and shall be carried out without delay.
────────────────────"
`;

