exports[`toDiscord on every form > small-claims-request-to-dismiss-case > empty, code tables 1`] = `
"────────────────────
### **Request to Dismiss Small Claims Case**
BRANCH NAME: __LOS SANTOS__
COURTHOUSE NAME: __SUPERIOR COURT__
CASE NUMBER: __YYSCSM#####__
FILING DATE: __DD/MMM/YYYY__
PLAINTIFF: __INSERT NAME__
DEFENDANT: __INSERT NAME__
────────────────────
*If you want to dismiss your small claims case, file this request with the court. A dismissal **__with__** prejudice means you will not be able to refile this claim in the future. Use that option if a settlement was reached and the defendant fully satisfied it. For any other reason, you should request a dismissal **__without__** prejudice, which means you are allowed to refile the same claim in the future. Regardless if the case is dismissed with or without prejudice, your filing fee will not be returned to you. If you file the claim again following a dismissal without prejudice, you will have to pay the filing fee again.*

TO THE COURT:
Please dismiss this action as follows (use "X" to mark one box only):
[] With prejudice.
[] Without prejudice.

Plaintiff's signature:
*Insert name*
────────────────────"
`;

