exports[`toDiscord on every form > supreme-judgement > empty, code tables 1`] = `
"────────────────────
**SAN ANDREAS SUPREME COURT**
────────────────────
**CASE NUMBER:** __YYSCWC#####__
────────────────────
**PLAINTIFF/PETITIONER:** __FIRSTNAME LASTNAME__
**DEFENDANT/RESPONDENT:** __FIRSTNAME LASTNAME__
**FILING DATE:** __DD/MMM/YYYY__
────────────────────

## **SUPREME COURT JUDGEMENT**

Following a Writ of Certiorari being presented, the Supreme Court of the State of San Andreas has taken time for proper legal consideration and, thereafter, a written opinion of the matters at hand has been produced. The Opinion of the Court is authored by **Chief Justice [NAME]**:
- **NARRATIVE**
And thus in support of the narrative, it is the finding of the court that in the case matter at hand, the court rules;

The Judgement of the Appellate Court of the State of San Andreas is:
**Reversed (and/or) Affimed**
**In Full/Part**

I declare under penalty of perjury under the laws of the State of San Andreas that the foregoing is true and correct.

__FIRSTNAME LASTNAME__
(JUSTICE OF THE SUPREME COURT)

__SIGNATURE__
